# Shaman (90/92/93/94; ShamanNodes): Searing Totem + Flame Shock single, LHW / HW below HealHpPct (any spec);
# multi Stoneclaw Totem / Flame Shock; emergency Shamanistic Rage / LHW / HW / Stoneclaw; escape Earthbind /
